---
import Page from '../layouts/Page.astro';
---

<Page title="Curriculum Vitae" description="Hyunuk Kim - CV">
  <div class="cv-container">
    <div class="cv-header">
      <h1>Hyunuk Kim, Ph.D.</h1>
      <p>Assistant Professor of Business Analytics</p>
      <p>Director, Center for Applied Analytics and AI</p>
      <p>Elon University</p>
      
      <div class="cv-download">
        <a href="/files/cv_hyunuk_kim.pdf" class="download-button" download>
          Download PDF CV
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="cv-content">
      <section class="cv-section">
        <h2>Contact Information</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:hkim6@elon.edu">hkim6@elon.edu</a></li>
          <li><strong>Institution:</strong> Elon University, Elon, NC, USA</li>
          <li><strong>Google Scholar:</strong> <a href="https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=HNotJa0AAAAJ" target="_blank">Profile</a></li>
          <li><strong>ORCID:</strong> <a href="https://orcid.org/0000-0002-4863-4729" target="_blank">0000-0002-4863-4729</a></li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="cv-section">
        <h2>Current Position</h2>
        <div class="position">
          <h3>Assistant Professor of Business Analytics</h3>
          <p class="org">Elon University | 2024 – Present</p>
          <p>Direct the Center for Applied Analytics and AI. Teach courses in business analytics, data science, and machine learning. Conduct research in network science, NLP, and computational social science.</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="cv-section">
        <h2>Previous Positions</h2>
        <div class="position">
          <h3>Assistant Professor</h3>
          <p class="org">Boston University Metropolitan College | 2022 – 2024</p>
          <p>Taught graduate and undergraduate courses in data science, statistics, and analytics. Conducted research and mentored students.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="position">
          <h3>Postdoctoral Associate</h3>
          <p class="org">Boston University Questrom School of Business | 2019 – 2022</p>
          <p>Institute for Health System Innovation & Policy. Advisor: Prof. Dylan Walker. Conducted research on health systems, information diffusion, and network analysis.</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="cv-section">
        <h2>Education</h2>
        <div class="education">
          <h3>Ph.D. in Physics</h3>
          <p class="org">Korea Advanced Institute of Science and Technology (KAIST)</p>
          <p>Advisors: Prof. Woo-Sung Jung, Prof. Hyejin Youn</p>
          <p>Focus: Network science, complex systems, and data-driven analysis</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="cv-section">
        <h2>Research Areas</h2>
        <ul class="research-areas">
          <li><strong>Network Science:</strong> Graph analysis, community detection, diffusion models</li>
          <li><strong>Natural Language Processing:</strong> Text mining, sentiment analysis, topic modeling</li>
          <li><strong>Machine Learning:</strong> Supervised and unsupervised learning, deep learning</li>
          <li><strong>Computational Social Science:</strong> Information dynamics, cultural evolution, misinformation</li>
          <li><strong>Applied Analytics:</strong> Business intelligence, decision support systems</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="cv-section">
        <h2>Teaching Experience</h2>
        <p>Courses taught in business analytics, data science, machine learning, network science, and statistical methods at both graduate and undergraduate levels.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="cv-section">
        <h2>Publications</h2>
        <p>Over 20 peer-reviewed publications in top-tier journals and conferences. See <a href="/publications">Publications</a> page for complete list.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="cv-section">
        <h2>Service & Leadership</h2>
        <ul class="service-list">
          <li>Director, Center for Applied Analytics and AI (Elon University)</li>
          <li>Reviewer for multiple journals and conferences</li>
          <li>Mentor for graduate and undergraduate students</li>
          <li>Collaborator with industry partners on applied research projects</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="cv-section">
        <h2>Technical Skills</h2>
        <div class="skills-grid">
          <div class="skill-group">
            <h4>Programming Languages</h4>
            <p>Python, R, Java, JavaScript</p>
          </div>
          <div class="skill-group">
            <h4>Data Science Tools</h4>
            <p>scikit-learn, TensorFlow, PyTorch, Pandas, NetworkX</p>
          </div>
          <div class="skill-group">
            <h4>NLP Tools</h4>
            <p>NLTK, spaCy, Transformers, Gensim</p>
          </div>
          <div class="skill-group">
            <h4>Databases & Tools</h4>
            <p>SQL, MongoDB, Git, Jupyter, Tableau</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="cv-section">
        <h2>Professional Development</h2>
        <p>Continuous learning and participation in workshops, conferences, and professional development activities in data science, machine learning, and computational social science.</p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>

  <style>
    .cv-container {
      max-width: 900px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .cv-header {
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 3rem;
      padding-bottom: 2rem;
      border-bottom: 2px solid var(--color-accent);
    }

    .cv-header h1 {
      font-size: 2.5rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }

    .cv-header p {
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      color: var(--color-text-secondary);
      margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
    }

    .cv-download {
      margin-top: 2rem;
    }

    .download-button {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
      background-color: var(--color-accent);
      color: white;
      border-radius: 6px;
      transition: background-color 0.2s;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 500;
    }

    .download-button:hover {
      background-color: var(--color-accent-hover);
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .cv-content {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 2rem;
    }

    .cv-section {
      padding-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }

    .cv-section h2 {
      font-size: 1.4rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
      color: var(--color-text);
      border-left: 4px solid var(--color-accent);
      padding-left: 1rem;
    }

    .cv-section ul {
      list-style: none;
      padding: 0;
    }

    .cv-section li {
      padding: 0.5rem 0;
      color: var(--color-text-secondary);
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .position {
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }

    .position h3 {
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--color-text);
      margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
    }

    .org {
      color: var(--color-accent);
      font-weight: 500;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }

    .position p:not(.org) {
      color: var(--color-text-secondary);
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .education {
      padding: 1rem;
      border-left: 3px solid var(--color-accent);
      padding-left: 1.5rem;
    }

    .education h3 {
      font-weight: 600;
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }

    .education p {
      color: var(--color-text-secondary);
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }

    .research-areas {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 0.75rem;
    }

    .research-areas li {
      color: var(--color-text-secondary);
      padding-left: 1.5rem;
      position: relative;
    }

    .research-areas li:before {
      content: "•";
      position: absolute;
      left: 0;
      color: var(--color-accent);
      font-weight: bold;
    }

    .service-list {
      list-style: none;
      padding: 0;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 0.75rem;
    }

    .service-list li {
      padding-left: 1.5rem;
      position: relative;
      color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    }

    .service-list li:before {
      content: "◆";
      position: absolute;
      left: 0;
      color: var(--color-accent);
      font-size: 0.7rem;
    }

    .skills-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));
      gap: 1.5rem;
    }

    .skill-group {
      padding: 1rem;
      border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
      border-radius: 6px;
    }

    .skill-group h4 {
      color: var(--color-accent);
      font-weight: 600;
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }

    .skill-group p {
      color: var(--color-text-secondary);
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      .cv-header h1 {
        font-size: 1.8rem;
      }

      .cv-section h2 {
        font-size: 1.2rem;
      }

      .skills-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
    }
  </style>
</Page>
